<title>DENMARK: Danish Kommunekredit ups 2002 4% pct bond amount.</title>
<headline>Danish Kommunekredit ups 2002 4% pct bond amount.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denmark's Kommunekredit raised an existing four percent bond due 2002 by 25 million crowns to 1.8 billion crowns, arranger Gudme Raaschou said in a statement distributed by Copenhagen Stock Exchange on Friday.</p>
<p>Raaschou said the lead manager was Jyske Bank and the bonds were already sold.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969652</p>
</text>
